* 2N3904 Emitter Follower Circuit
* Integration test with the project's example NPN model

.INCLUDE ../models/example_npn.inc

* Power supply
Vcc vcc 0 DC 12

* Input signal (DC bias + small AC)
Vin in 0 DC 2.5 AC 0.1

* Input coupling capacitor
Cin in base 10u

* Base bias resistors (voltage divider)
R1 vcc base 47k
R2 base 0 10k

* Emitter follower transistor
Q1 vcc base emitter 2N3904

* Emitter resistor
Re emitter 0 2.2k

* Output coupling capacitor
Cout emitter out 10u

* Load resistor
Rload out 0 10k

* Analysis
.DC Vin 0 5 0.1

.end
